You're Registered!

Hi <%= @ticket.attendee_name %>,

Your registration is confirmed. Here are your ticket details:

Event: <%= @event.title %>
Date: <%= @event.start_date.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %>
<% if @event.event_locations.any? %>
Venue: <%= @event.event_locations.first.name %>
<% end %>
Ticket Type: <%= @ticket_type.name %>

Your Ticket ID: <%= @ticket.public_id %>

<% if @show_payment_receipt %>
Payment Receipt
- Receipt No: <%= @ticket.public_id %>
- Payment Status: Paid
- Payment Date: <%= @ticket_payment&.paid_at.present? ? @ticket_payment.paid_at.in_time_zone.strftime("%B %d, %Y %I:%M %p %Z") : 'Not available' %>
- Amount Paid: <%= (@ticket_payment&.currency.presence || 'MYR') %> <%= format('%.2f', (@ticket_payment&.amount || @ticket_type.current_price).to_f) %>
- Transaction ID: <%= @ticket_payment&.gateway_payment_id.presence || 'Not available' %>
- Order ID: <%= @ticket_payment&.gateway_response&.dig('order_id').presence || 'Not available' %>
<% end %>

Please show this ticket ID or the attached QR code at check-in.

<% if @contact_email.present? %>
Should you have any questions, please reach out to us at <%= @contact_email %>.
<% end %>
See you at the event!

Warm regards,
<%= @sender_name %>

